#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn how to use and build Qiskit Function templates."
msgstr "Pelajari cara menggunakan dan membina templat Fungsi Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Function templates"
msgstr "Templat Fungsi Qiskit"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Function templates {#introduction-to-qiskit-function-templates}"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada templat Fungsi Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit-function-templates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Function templates](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) are an open-source collection of realistic code examples that give you access to some of the latest research workflows that leverage tools like the Qiskit SDK and [Qiskit addons](/guides/addons). These pre-built workflows take information from practical experiments and package them in a way that you can customize and reuse in your own research so that you don't have to build from scratch. All templates are readily deployable to [Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless) where you can easily leverage classical compute as part of your workflow.\n"
msgstr "[Templat fungsi Qiskit](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) adalah koleksi sumber terbuka contoh kod realistik yang memberi anda akses kepada beberapa aliran kerja penyelidikan terkini yang memanfaatkan alatan seperti Qiskit SDK dan [tambahan Qiskit](/guides/addons). Aliran kerja yang telah dibina ini mengambil maklumat dari eksperimen praktikal dan mengemasnya dengan cara yang boleh anda sesuaikan dan gunakan semula dalam penyelidikan anda sendiri supaya anda tidak perlu membina dari awal. Semua templat boleh digunakan secara terus ke [Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless) di mana anda boleh dengan mudah memanfaatkan pengkomputeran klasikal sebagai sebahagian dari aliran kerja anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two types of templates:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat dua jenis templat:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Template implementations*: Specialized code examples that implement advanced techniques from real-world experiments in areas like chemistry and physics.\n"
msgstr "*Implementasi templat*: Contoh kod khusus yang mengimplementasikan teknik lanjutan dari eksperimen dunia nyata dalam bidang seperti kimia dan fizik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Base templates*: References for developing your own original Qiskit Function. These templates highlight best-practices in interface development, code formatting, unit testing, and more.\n"
msgstr "*Templat asas*: Rujukan untuk membangunkan Fungsi Qiskit asal anda sendiri. Templat ini menonjolkan amalan terbaik dalam pembangunan antara muka, pemformatan kod, ujian unit, dan lain-lain.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Template implementations {#template-implementations}"
msgstr "Implementasi templat {#template-implementations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Function template implementations are organized by application area. Currently included in the collection are two physics templates that use the [AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/) (one for Hamiltonian simulation and one for AQC + Trotter Hamiltonian dynamics) and a chemistry template for electronic structure with the implicit solvent model using the [SQD Qiskit addon](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd).\n"
"Resources to get started with these templates are available at the following links:\n"
msgstr ""
"Implementasi templat Fungsi Qiskit dianjurkan mengikut bidang aplikasi. Kini termasuk dalam koleksi ialah dua templat fizik yang menggunakan [tambahan Qiskit AQC-Tensor](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor/) (satu untuk simulasi Hamiltonian dan satu untuk dinamik Hamiltonian AQC + Trotter) dan templat kimia untuk struktur elektronik dengan model pelarut tersirat menggunakan [tambahan Qiskit SQD](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd).\n"
"Sumber untuk memulakan dengan templat-templat ini tersedia di pautan berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Electronic structure simulation with implicit solvent model: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/chemistry/sqd_pcm) and [guide](/guides/function-template-chemistry-workflow)\n"
msgstr "Simulasi struktur elektronik dengan model pelarut tersirat: [fail sumber templat](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/chemistry/sqd_pcm) dan [panduan](/guides/function-template-chemistry-workflow)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonian simulation: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/hamiltonian_simulation) and [guide](/guides/function-template-hamiltonian-simulation)\n"
msgstr "Simulasi Hamiltonian: [fail sumber templat](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/hamiltonian_simulation) dan [panduan](/guides/function-template-hamiltonian-simulation)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "AQC + Trotter Hamiltonian dynamics: [template source files](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter) and [guide](/guides/function-template-aqc-trotter)\n"
msgstr "Dinamik Hamiltonian AQC + Trotter: [fail sumber templat](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter) dan [panduan](/guides/function-template-aqc-trotter)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Base templates {#base-templates}"
msgstr "Templat asas {#base-templates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The *base templates* are references for developing your own original Qiskit Function. They are designed to help you kickstart the development process by illustrating best practices in interface development, code formatting, I/O handling, error messages, checkpoints, unit testing, and more. The repository is exposed as a [GitHub template](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/creating-a-template-repository) so that the CI/CD implementation can be easily extended.\n"
msgstr "*Templat asas* adalah rujukan untuk membangunkan Fungsi Qiskit asal anda sendiri. Ia direka untuk membantu anda memulakan proses pembangunan dengan menggambarkan amalan terbaik dalam pembangunan antara muka, pemformatan kod, pengendalian I/O, mesej ralat, titik semak, ujian unit, dan lain-lain. Repositori ini didedahkan sebagai [templat GitHub](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/creating-a-template-repository) supaya implementasi CI/CD boleh dilanjutkan dengan mudah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are currently two templates: a [circuit function template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/circuit_function_template.py) and an [application function template](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/application_function_template.py).\n"
msgstr "Kini terdapat dua templat: [templat fungsi Circuit](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/circuit_function_template.py) dan [templat fungsi aplikasi](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/blob/main/base_templates/application_function_template.py).\n"

